ss="management-empty">No support requests yet.</p><?php endif; ?></div><div class="management-case-panel"><h3>Enquiries <span><?= count($data['contactRequests']) ?></span></h3><?php foreach (array_slice($data['contactRequests'], 0, 8) as $contact): ?><article class="management-case"><span class="management-state"><?= $escape(ucfirst($contact['status'])) ?></span><h4><?= $escape($contact['subject']) ?></h4><p><?= $escape($contact['name']) ?> · <?= $escape($contact['email']) ?></p><?php if ($contact['status'] === 'open'): ?><form method="post" action="/contact/resolve"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?= $escape($data['csrfToken']) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= $escape($contact['id']) ?>"><button type="submit">Mark resolved</button></form><?php endif; ?></article><?php endforeach; ?><?php if ($data['contactRequests'] === []): ?><p class="management-empty">No enquiries yet.</p><?php endif; ?></div></div></section>
